      <section class="dd-route" aria-labelledby="dd-route-title">
        <div class="dd-section-caption"><span>THE ROADMAP</span><h2 id="dd-route-title">先看全貌，再逐步展开。</h2><p>每一步都有输入、动作、复核要点与交付物。</p></div>
        <ol class="dd-route-list">
          <li v-for="(phase, index) in phases" :key="phase.id"><a :href="`#${phase.id}`"><span class="dd-route-number">0{{ index + 1 }}</span><b>{{ phase.name }}</b><small>步骤 {{ phase.range }}</small><span class="dd-route-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
